refpb\">b</span>,\n<span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> crainte à l’égard <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> au sujet de qqn <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> de\nqqe ch. ; <span class=\"grec\">φ. βαρϐάρων,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">An.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 2, 18,</span> crainte éprouvée par les barbares ;\n<span class=\"ital\">avec l’inf. précédé de l’art.</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">An.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">3, 1, 18 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Rsp.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">360</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span>, <span class=\"ital\">etc.,</span> <span class=\"ital\">ou sans article,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">An.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">2, 4, 2,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span>\nla crainte de, <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">suivi de</span> <span class=\"grec\">μή,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Cyr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 5, 48 ;</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Hier.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">11, 11 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">de</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ὡς μή,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Hipp.</span> <span class=\"refch\">5, 3 ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">simpl. de</span> <span class=\"grec\">ὡς,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Soph.</span>\n<span class=\"refpa\">268</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span> ;\n<span class=\"ital\">d’une prop. relat.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Or.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1316 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">de</span> <span class=\"grec\">ὅπως μή,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Conv.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">193</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span> ; <span class=\"ital\">de</span> <span class=\"grec\">ὥστε μή,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">I.T.<